{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1321714-what-is-the-red-pool","id":1321714,"title":"What is the Red Pool?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-01T07:23:56-07:00","id":1321714,"title":"What is the Red Pool?","content":"<b>Trinity Core</b> p. 97 - &quot;Each time the item is used, the Storyguide gets to add one Momentum to the Red Pool.&quot;<br /> <br /> What is this this Red Pool? It <i>does not exists</i> in <b>Scion</b>, at least from my reading of <b>Origin</b> and <b>Hero</b> books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-01T07:32:27-07:00","id":1321719,"title":"","content":"At a guess, I'd say it means the tension pool, the NPC version of the momentum pool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-01T07:40:33-07:00","id":1321721,"title":"","content":"Earlier drafts of Storypath called the momentum and tension pools black and red pools. This reference must not have been updated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","nam